{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo Prologue chapter of Sea of Tranquility, underlying some of the events before the main game. Witness the final moments of moon colonization by humanity as you prepare for you own departure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the last moments of moon colonization in the Prologue chapter of Sea Of Tranquility and get a glimpse of why the Moon is stranger than earlier thought.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different levels with unique content varying from an observatory station, warehouse section and the silent planes of the Moon in your spacesuit with as you evacuate yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various puzzles to test your wits along with esoteric moon ambiance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo autosaves your progress between the levels.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098780?t=1761411934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098780?t=1761411934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098780/3655f1ef2d36c44000162f55817491cda5358693/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761411934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098780/3655f1ef2d36c44000162f55817491cda5358693/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761411934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo Prologue chapter of Sea of Tranquility, underlying some of the events before the main game. Witness the final moments of moon colonization by humanity as you prepare for you own departure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the last moments of moon colonization in the Prologue chapter of Sea Of Tranquility and get a glimpse of why the Moon is stranger than earlier thought.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different levels with unique content varying from an observatory station, warehouse section and the silent planes of the Moon in your spacesuit with as you evacuate yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various puzzles to test your wits along with esoteric moon ambiance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo autosaves your progress between the levels.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sky Trail Ltd"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3784750","name":"Sea of Tranquility"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098780/59f032e148f21a81d3f80ba0049185471d299448/header.jpg?t=1761411934","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098780/485308892/1ba1423c8e88c7b4fc90bec5dfc05583fb7177cc/1760013305/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761411932","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098780/485308892/1ba1423c8e88c7b4fc90bec5dfc05583fb7177cc/1760013305/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761411932","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098780/485308892/1ba1423c8e88c7b4fc90bec5dfc05583fb7177cc/1760013305/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761411932","id":257214816,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_